utes in the context of the OOPIF, not the top-level privileged CWS origin. Due to SOP, the malicious script cannot access the CWS DOM, read its cookies, or call privileged CWS internal APIs.\\n*   **Boundary Crossing:** To escalate this into a severe vulnerability (like forced extension installation), the attacker would need a secondary vulnerability—such as the CWS parent window improperly handling a `postMessage` sent from the compromised iframe.\\n*   **Defense:** Defensive strategies for privileged domains involve minimizing cross-origin iframes where possible, implementing strict Content Security Policies (CSP) to restrict where iframes can load resources from, and ensuring robust validation on any cross-document messaging (e.g., `window.addEventListener(\\\"message\\\")`).\", \"refusal\": null, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"annotations\": null, \"audio\": null, \"function_call\": null, \"tool_calls\": null}}], \"created\": 1787916381, \"model\": \"gemini-3.1-pro\", \"object\": \"chat.completion\", \"metadata\": null, \"moderation\": null, \"service_tier\": null, \"system_fingerprint\": null, \"usage\": {\"completion_tokens\": 1934, \"prompt_tokens\": 5820, \"total_tokens\": 7754, \"completion_tokens_details\": {\"accepted_prediction_tokens\": null, \"audio_tokens\": 0, \"reasoning_tokens\": 1264, \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": null, \"text_tokens\": 670, \"image_tokens\": 0}, \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\"audio_tokens\": 0, \"cache_write_tokens\": ...<truncated>"}
